WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.761
Every lesson here uses a monthly income of 5,000

00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:09.250
pesos to 15,000 pesos That is pension savings and

00:00:09.276 --> 00:00:13.895
family support combined Your own numbers replace it wherever

00:00:13.961 --> 00:00:14.829
Jinnie has them

00:00:20.743 --> 00:00:25.548
You turn sixty You have stopped working A neighbor

00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:28.351
says you must wait until sixty-five to claim

00:00:34.265 --> 00:00:38.360
Sixty is a choice not a rule You decide

00:00:38.373 --> 00:00:39.189
when to stop
